      "page_idx": 401,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.13,
            0.812,
            0.162
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "参读材料一 随机变量样本值的产生"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.209,
            0.373,
            0.226
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（一）随机数和伪随机数"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.232,
            0.883,
            0.34
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在概率统计的应用中,常需要模拟各种分布的随机变量,即需要产生各种分布随机变量的简单随机样本的样本值.某一分布随机变量的样本值,就称为这一分布的随机数.例如指数分布随机变量的样本值就称为指数分布随机数.特别,区间(0,1)上均匀分布的随机变量的样本值称为均匀分布随机数,简称随机数.我们先来考虑如何产生均匀分布随机数,其他分布随机数一般可以由均匀分布随机数通过变换得到."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.345,
            0.883,
            0.407
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "产生均匀分布随机数的方法很多,目前使用最广泛的方法是在计算机上利用数学的递推公式来产生.这种按确定性算法得到的序列,不可能是真正来自区间(0,1)上均匀分布的独立同分布样本值序列,我们称它为伪随机数."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.413,
            0.883,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在大多数计算机中都装有产生伪随机数序列的算法程序,我们都假设由这些程序产生的伪随机数序列能通过独立性和均匀分布检验,可作为随机数序列来使用,需要时用特定的命令加以调用就是."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.481,
            0.504,
            0.498
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（二）产生离散型随机变量样本值的方法"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.504,
            0.446,
            0.52
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "设离散型随机变量 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 具有分布律"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.317,
            0.527,
            0.88,
            0.561
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_401_equation_7.jpg",
          "content": "P \\{X = x _ {i} \\} = p _ {i}, \\quad i = 1, 2, \\dots , \\quad \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {\\infty} p _ {i} = 1. \\tag {*_{1}}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.563,
            0.336,
            0.579
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "现在来产生 X 的随机数."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.58,
            0.35,
            0.596
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "先产生伪随机数 u, 令"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.368,
            0.604,
            0.88,
            0.706
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_401_equation_10.jpg",
          "content": "X = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} x _ {1}, & u <   p _ {1}, \\\\ x _ {2}, & p _ {1} \\leqslant u <   p _ {1} + p _ {2}, \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots \\\\ x _ {i}, & \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {i - 1} p _ {j} \\leqslant u <   \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {i} p _ {j}, \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots \\end{array} \\right. \\tag {*_{2}}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.711,
            0.176,
            0.727
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "由于"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.185,
            0.732,
            0.828,
            0.771
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_401_equation_12.jpg",
          "content": "P \\{X = x _ {i} \\} = P \\Bigl \\{\\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {i - 1} p _ {j} \\leqslant u <   \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {i} p _ {j} \\Bigr \\} = \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {i} p _ {j} - \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {i - 1} p _ {j} = p _ {i}, \\quad i = 1, 2, \\dots ,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.777,
            0.356,
            0.794
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "所以 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 具有给定的分布律."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.8,
            0.882,
            0.839
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "产生随机变量 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的样本值也叫做对随机变量 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 进行模拟或抽样，上述模拟离散型随机变量的方法的算法为:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.846,
            0.308,
            0.861
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "产生伪随机数 u."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.868,
            0.384,
            0.884
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "若  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "u < p_{1}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，令  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X = x_{1}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，停止。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.891,
            0.421,
            0.907
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "若 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "u < p_1 + p_2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，令 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X = x_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，停止."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
